From 01ece65fcc362b4d5657e3ee62d6fcdab85e070c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: callan <callanf@nvidia.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:30:03 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 25/38] native_host_offload.vllm_recency (off by default): G2
 ranks blocks as vLLM's offloading LRU does: a store or KVCR landing is ranked
 at admission in request order (LRUCachePolicy.insert from prepare_store), and
 pins and completions never re-rank (prepare_load and complete_load,
 complete_store re-enter through mark_evictable at the block's rank); touches
 re-rank any held block; unit tests

---
 crates/core/src/engine/config.rs              | 11 +++
 .../core/src/engine/host_offload/registry.rs  |  2 +
 crates/core/src/engine/host_offload/tier.rs   | 90 +++++++++++++++++--
 3 files changed, 96 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/crates/core/src/engine/config.rs b/crates/core/src/engine/config.rs
